msgid ""
"Records displayed in the Kanban can be narrowed down using :ref:`grouping "
"<events/tracks-dashboard/group>` and :ref:`filter <events/tracks-dashboard/"
"filter>` options."
msgstr ""
"Записи, відображені у Kanban, можна звузити за допомогою "
"параметрів :ref:`групування <events/tracks-dashboard/group>` "
"та :ref:`фільтрування <events/tracks-dashboard/filter>`."

#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/events/attendee_experience/event_tracks.rst:65
#: ../../export/content/applications/marketing/events/event_reporting/attendees_report.rst:75
